Effect of Feed Additive on the Mineral Composition of Quail Blood

LV Kletikova*, MS Mannova, NN Yakimenko, EE Malinovskaya
FGBOU HE Ivanovskaya State Agricultural Academy, 45, Sovietskayast., Ivanovo, 153012, Russia
Received – December 22, 2021; Revision – February 04, 2022; Accepted – February 24, 2022
