+- [[products/rice-bulk-grain]]
+- [[products/utensils-metal]]
+- [[products/cookware-metal-alloy]]
+- [[products/cookware-nonstick-coated]]
+- [[metals/aluminum]]
+- [[metals/lead]]
+- [[metals/cadmium]]
+- [[metals/arsenic-total]]
+- [[metals/chromium]]
+
+## Verification notes
+
+The abstract provides the headline concentrations and risk metrics. The source does not support an inorganic arsenic claim.
